20260527.115858.581 [>kpop..........] - **Hypothesize**: Hypothesize one falsifiable explanation of the cause of the problem.
20260527.115858.581 [>kpop..........] - **Predict**: Define a falsifying test. If the hypothesis were true, what outcome would the test produce?
20260527.115858.581 [>kpop..........] - **Falsify**: Run the test. If falsified, reject the hypothesis.
